      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TAW MYSTIQUE (1) is a fast dog well performed over the sprint races. Was a bit beyond her last time when fourth (24.84) over 440m at Goulburn in a Grade 5 but is better suited here over less ground. Has never been out of the money in five starts this distance. Looks the one to beat on her best form. NATURAL SPARK (8) was game in defeat at the latest run, finishing second and beaten a neck (20.89) behind Dundee Spike at this track. Expected to be in the finish again. ANY MORE TRAINS (2) turned in a moderate effort last time when seventh at this track over 365m behind Hot Spark (21.54) in a Grade 5. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and five minor placings to his credit. A big run wouldn't surprise. SPEEDY VAN WEZEL (3) placed last time and cannot be ignored.",
